title: StartD21
---
<<wait  2>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity "NEXT DAY" false>>
[i]Your eyes open slowly, while pain throbs through your body. [/i]
[i]Your arms seem to be sore.[/i]
[i]Memories flood your mind, and with a slow move you sit up from the bed[/i]
[i]You walk out to the kitchen.[/i]
[i]You see the hammer still laying on the table...[/i]

<<set_enabled_in_unity "PhoneBuzzing" true>>
BZZTT //play sound PhoneBuzzing
You: Must be Peeko.
Peeko: Heeyyyy! Are you awake yet?!! //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: You haven't opened my app for three days! 
Peeko: I missed you! I was lonely! //play sound CharacterDialogue
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoSad" true>>
Peeko: How could you ever do that to me?! //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: Well...enough talking, you have to help me now!! //play sound CharacterDialogue
You: Help you...how? What was the weird message even about?
Peeko: What did you not understand about it?! //play sound CharacterDialogue
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoMad" true>>
Peeko: It clearly spelled 'LET ME OUT' so that's what you need to do. //play sound CharacterDialogue
[i]You stared at your phone screen dumbfounded.[/i]
You: Peeko...you're a virtual pet. I- how could I possibly let you out.
// ANGRY PEEKO ANIMATION
[i]Peeko's face visibly became angrier.[/i]
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoMad2" true>>
Peeko:I dont want to be virtual! //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: I want to get out, to live in your world. //play sound CharacterDialogue
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoMad3" true>>
Peeko: Haven't you noticed?! Your apartment has been different lately. //play sound CharacterDialogue
You: So, that was not an hallucination??
Peeko: I have been trying to fuse our minds together, 
Peeko: in preparation for the last step. //play sound CharacterDialogue
You: Fuse our minds? You've been messing with my brain?
Peeko: It's all for the good of our friendship, trust me. //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: [b]Let me take over your body, that way we can be together forever[/b] //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: [b]We'll never have to be apart again.[/b] //play sound CharacterDialogue
You: What?! Fuse our minds? Take over my body? No-I can't- this is crazy!
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoMad4" true>>
[i]You took ahold of the hammer and with a swift glance at your phone you made your decision. [/i]
[i]You set your phone on the table and smashed with the hammer without hesitation. [/i] //play sound SmashingMicrowave
[i]You must destroy all the electronics in your home to stop Peeko. [/i]
<<set_enable_in_unity "Good Ending" true>>
[i]After smashing your phone, You didn't have to worry about a threatening creature taking over you anymore, [/i]
[i][b]you won.[/b][/i]
===